          "author": "KIDZ BOP",
          "description": "KIDZ BOP 2022, the biggest KIDZ BOP album of the year, is here! It’s jam packed with today’s biggest pop hits including “Good 4 U,” “Peaches,” “Levitating,” “Drivers License” and more sung by the KIDZ BOP Kids. KIDZ BOP is the #1 kids music brand and delivers the songs that kids love and parents can feel good about. KIDZ BOP 2022 is sure to be an instant favorite among families everywhere.\n\nTracks include:\n1) Good 4 U\n2) Levitating\n3) Montero (Call Me By Your Name)\n4) Peaches\n5) Drivers License\n6) Butter\n7) Astronaut In The Ocean\n8) Save Your Tears\n9) Mood\n10) Dynamite",
